; The one variable: every Control draws its default-theme icon at theme scale 1. Godot rasterises each
; icon with ThorVG (`default_theme.cpp:82-84`), and the previewer draws Godot's own raster of it
; (`themeIconRasters.generated.ts`). Covers the check family, OptionButton, SpinBox, LineEdit clear,
; TabBar close, sliders, FoldableContainer, the GraphEdit toolbar, an embedded Window and ColorPicker.

